WEBVTT

00:32:28.576 --> 00:32:32.195
You don't have to look for it,
you don't have to romanticize it,

00:32:32.219 --> 00:32:34.765
and you don't have to glamorize it,

00:32:34.789 --> 00:32:39.287
because it's part of the experience
of what we come here and experience.

00:32:39.311 --> 00:32:43.792
And what I went through
in the 18 months of loving Rayya

00:32:43.816 --> 00:32:45.675
and nursing her through her cancer,

00:32:45.699 --> 00:32:49.441
watching her just be destroyed
by this disease,

00:32:50.744 --> 00:32:52.542
was so horrific,

00:32:52.566 --> 00:32:57.207
that it's shocking
how much you can suffer.

00:32:57.231 --> 00:33:00.552
My experience with suffering
is that true suffering --